## Standing banked ground (from RT#4/#5, §334-344 — do not re-derive)
- 3-clause gate for any middle object: non-conservative + constructible-without-zeros + manifestly positive.
  Every toured RH-equivalent is a conservative biconditional. Edge-vs-center law: only Re=1 (edge)
  coordinates have ever delivered theorems; every Re=½ (center) coordinate came back as ζ.
- Collapse = critical-density sampling at the RvM/Weyl count ("Nyquist in the zeros"), sign-blind controls
  show no threshold; the discreteness of the zero set carries everything (§335). Fluctuation identity:
  zeroGram − archdensityGram = pole − prime exactly (§335). Lit foundations published (BGL frame bounds,
  Landau–Widom, BRS/Kulikov, Kurasov–Sarnak); the synthesis appears unpublished (§336).
- Q5 ruling: "zeros = maximal-density sampling set" = the wall re-lettered (names its object by the zeros,
  center-coordinate, conservative at critical density). Only prime-side middle objects admissible.
- Q1→Q4 reduction: minor arc (off-resonant primes) = large-sieve/density-only input; major arc = the
  near-resonant set. Measured resonance law: log n* ≈ 2π/s (Bragg). [The "n*=γ/2π = RS crossover" line in
  older docs was an ANNOTATION, never measured — retracted §343. s↔γ calibration still open.]
- Cost object fusion: per-term cost = coupling²/gap_residual; criterion = marginal buyback d(gap)/dR.
  Frobenius Σ|c_k|² ≥ ‖offblock‖ unconditionally (modulus kills phases — no smuggling); phases enter as
  WITNESS columns only; the only admissible phase-cancellation rescue must derive from θ(γ) + functional
  equation alone. Table rule, standing: ANNOTATIONS FOLLOW MEASUREMENTS.

## THE NEW ARCHITECTURE (§345-350, measured this run — the thing to attack)
The night's arc: per-prime chains → collective-tail chain → hybrid chain. Current best state:

1. **Deconfounded count law (§346):** the resonant exact core needed at fixed margin depth is
   **R ≈ 40/w² — a stable QUADRATIC** in 1/w (w=3→1.2 measured; R·w² = 36-44 const). Both "R linear"
   (RT#5) and "exponent accelerating to 3" (§344) were depth-aliasing artifacts. k=3 directional
   saturation breaks at w=1.3 (k=5 saves R 66→42; flat beyond): the directional block grows too —
   the per-prime wall is 2D in (R, k), both polynomial.
2. **The collective-tail chain (§346-347):** split P = P_small(n<n0, exact) + tail → PNT smooth main term
   (one elementary integral) + fluctuation charge ‖ΔT‖. Partial summation against |ψ(x)−x| prices ‖ΔT‖
   nearly TIGHT (loss ≤6x — the feared oscillation-frequency blowup does NOT occur; no large sieve needed).
   With cuts n0 = 300/2000-3000/5000-10000 (w = 2/1.5/1.2) the chain gets **FULL REACH** — certifies the
   deepest PSD grid row above the Weyl rank limit at every width tested.
3. **The ε-budget race (§348):** T-AXIS IS FLAT — winning cut n0* does NOT climb with band height
   ([14,44]/[50,80]/[100,130] all n0*=300 at w=2). The entire uniformity cost is ONE AXIS (w):
   n0* ~ e^{10.5/w}. STRUCTURAL SURPRISE: the race is won by the Gaussian envelope, not PNT strength —
   required-ε crosses O(1) while available-ε barely moves; **Chebyshev-grade |ψ−x| ≤ 0.06x suffices**.
   Corollary (two-sided): named explicit constants are trivially available (victory margins 18-1693x);
   AND stronger prime knowledge buys ~nothing — the e^{c/w} cut growth is intrinsic to any
   split-at-a-scale architecture. PNT strength alone cannot win the w→0 race on this front.
4. **THE HYBRID CHAIN (§349) — current best certificate architecture:**
     pole (closed form) + arch (§341-minorant-able) − R resonant primes exact (R = 16-35 ≈ 40/w²)
     − 2-block directional gap bound (k=5) on remaining primes < n0 (closed-form sum, bulk-bounded)
     − smooth tail integral − ε·(explicit charge matrix) − Gaussian tail bound.
   FULL REACH at every w (deepest row: 92%/86%/46% of true margin at w=2/1.5/1.2), zero-free,
   formula-only shape. **Exponential BULK (n0 ~ e^{10.5/w}, enters only as summation ranges),
   polynomial STRUCTURE (R ~ 40/w², k=5).** The §342 difficulty conservation now lives entirely in
   bulk objects handled wholesale by norm/directional bounds.
5. **Arb-rigor (§340 + §350):** B_full PD theorem-grade at w=3 s=3.5/3.4 (§340). §350: the COLLECTIVE
   certificate is now THEOREM-GRADE at w=2, s=3.9 — interval LDL^T on B_lower with arithmetic input =
   79 explicit prime powers + ε ≤ 0.0325 PROVED in-script (exhaustive interval check of |ψ−x|/x on
